@startuml automated-pipeline-tobe
title To-be — fully automated JD → hire (moss = live · coral = human gate · dashed = to build)

actor "Recruiter" as rec

[JD authoring\nneed -> design draft] <<auto>> as jd
[JD -> structured Job\ningest + taxonomy resolve] <<gap>> as ingest
[Distribute to boards / ATS\n+ candidate fan-out] <<gap>> as dist
[Candidate apply / CV upload] <<auto>> as apply
[Extract text + LLM fields\nClaude CLI + deterministic fallback] <<auto>> as extract
[Archetype route -> V2 profile\nprovenance · potential] <<gap>> as v2
[Match\nKO · score · reason] <<auto>> as match
[AI screening\nfairness-gated recommendation] <<auto>> as screen
[Decisions queue\nearly-career · low-confidence] <<gate>> as decide
[Outreach + interview invite\n(delivered, not just drafted)] <<gap>> as engage
[Interview prep + scorecard\nsynthesis] <<auto>> as interview
[Offer decision] <<gate>> as offer
[Deliver offer · capture\naccept / decline] <<gap>> as close
[Hired -> onboarding handoff] <<gap>> as hire

[Scheduler / cron\ndrives time-based steps] <<gap>> as cron

rec --> jd
jd --> ingest
ingest --> dist
dist --> apply
apply --> extract
extract --> v2
v2 --> match
match --> screen
screen --> decide
decide --> engage
engage --> interview
interview --> offer
offer --> close
close --> hire
cron ..> screen : nightly pass
cron ..> decide : aging nudges
@enduml
